{"package":"Gz-Db","version":"0.1.0","assessment":"incomplete","packageSha256":"79a8b3cf60816d6af2e8b7e129e44846d057b219cc2c26911a929129d9773a02","scannedAt":"2026-10-24T09:48:05.689Z","scannerVersion":"0.1.0","rulesetVersion":"0.1.0","tools":{"powerShell":"7.5.12","psscriptAnalyzer":"1.25.0","psscriptAnalyzerExpected":"1.25.0"},"packageUrl":"https://www.powershellgallery.com/packages/Gz-Db/0.1.0","metadata":{"title":"Gz-Db","description":"\r\n# Gz-Db Module\r\n\r\nDatabase agnostic Powershell functions over ADO.NET.\r\n\r\nThe primary functions are Invoke-GzDbCommand, Read-GzDbData, and Write-GzDbData. If\r\na connection or connectionString is not provided to the functions, the functions\r\nwill attempt to use the default connection set by Set-GzDbConnectionString.\r\n\r\nAny function that has a `-Do` parameter, can be passed a script block that will\r\nhave the `$_` context variable set with either the connection or command object.\r\n\r\nSqlite is bundled with module.  To switch the default provider use:\r\n\r\n```powershell\r\nSet-GzDbProviderFactoryDefault \"Sqlite\"\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Examples\r\n\r\n\r\n- Set-GzDbConnectionString - sets the default or a named connection string.\r\n- New-GzDbConnection - creates a new connection\r\n- Write-GzDbData - inserts or updates data in the database.\r\n- Read-GzDbData - reads data from the database.\r\n- Invoke-GzDbCommand - executes a statement such as create database or grants.\r\n\r\n```powershell\r\nSet-GzDbConnectionString \"Server=localhost;Database=test;Integrate Security=true\" -Name \"Default\"\r\n\r\n# uses the default connection string set above \r\n$data = Read-GzDbData \"SELECT name FROM [users]\"\r\nWrite-Host $data  \r\n\r\n# control the connection\r\n$connection = New-GzDbConnection -ConnectionString $cs\r\n$connection.Open()\r\n\r\n$emails = $connection | Read-GzDbData \"SELECT email FROM [users]\"\r\n$connection | Write-GzDbData \"INSERT [name] INTO [user_roles] ([name], [role]) VALUES (@name, 1)\" -Parameters @{name = \"test\"}\r\n\r\n$connection.Dispose()\r\n\r\n# opens and closes the connection\r\n# autocreates a `$Connection` variable\r\n# returns any output.\r\n$data = New-GzDbConnection -Do {\r\n   return  $Connection | Read-GzDbData \"SELECT email FROM [users]\"\r\n}\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Gz Prefix\r\n\r\nThe Gz prefix exists to clobbering. \r\n\r\nAdd-GzDbAlias will set aliases that map to GzDb functions .e.g. Invoke-DbCommand\r\nwill be mapped to Invoke-GzDbCommand.  \r","authors":"Nerdy Mishka Michael Herndon","owners":"NerdyMishka","projectUrl":"https://gitlab.com/nerdymishka/gainz/tree/master/powershell/Gz-Db","publishedAt":"2019-03-17T19:26:11.703","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T05:00:01.333","tags":["SQL","ADO.NET","ado","Db","Query","Database","SqlClient","Gainz","Gz","Gainz-SqlDb","Windows","Mac","Linux","PSModule","PSEdition_Desktop","PSEdition_Core","PSFunction_Add-GzDbAlias","PSCommand_Add-GzDbAlias","PSFunction_Add-GzDbProviderFactory","PSCommand_Add-GzDbProviderFactory","PSFunction_Get-GzDbOption","PSCommand_Get-GzDbOption","PSFunction_Set-GzDbOption","PSCommand_Set-GzDbOption","PSFunction_Set-GzDbConnectionString","PSCommand_Set-GzDbConnectionString","PSFunction_Get-GzDbConnectionString","PSCommand_Get-GzDbConnectionString","PSFunction_New-GzDbProviderFactory","PSCommand_New-GzDbProviderFactory"]},"dependencies":[],"fileInventory":[{"path":"_rels/.rels","size":499,"crc32":"187aef8f","extension":"rels"},{"path":"Gz-Db.nuspec","size":3879,"crc32":"8fc8fad4","extension":"nuspec"},{"path":"Gz-Db.psd1","size":6818,"crc32":"adf3e36e","extension":"psd1"},{"path":"Gz-Db.psm1","size":1104,"crc32":"24469294","extension":"psm1"},{"path":"LICENSE","size":586,"crc32":"8abbff67","extension":"license"},{"path":"README.md","size":1165,"crc32":"fb13708d","extension":"md"},{"path":"bin/SQLite.Interop.dll","size":1612800,"crc32":"3c344ebb","extension":"dll"},{"path":"bin/System.Data.SQLite.dll","size":350208,"crc32":"8caad72d","extension":"dll"},{"path":"bin/System.Data.SQLite.dll.config","size":736,"crc32":"6d0730d2","extension":"config"},{"path":"bin/System.Data.SQLite.xml","size":1086294,"crc32":"caede600","extension":"xml"},{"path":"bin/runtimes/linux-x64/SQLite.Interop.dll","size":2644400,"crc32":"7427c741","extension":"dll"},{"path":"bin/runtimes/osx-x64/SQLite.Interop.dll","size":1895724,"crc32":"4d1580f6","extension":"dll"},{"path":"bin/runtimes/win-x64/SQLite.Interop.dll","size":1612800,"crc32":"3c344ebb","extension":"dll"},{"path":"bin/runtimes/win-x86/SQLite.Interop.dll","size":1251840,"crc32":"29d9c9e5","extension":"dll"},{"path":"public/Add-GzDbAlias.ps1","size":1680,"crc32":"dd2aa629","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/Add-GzDbParameter.ps1","size":3559,"crc32":"f6b791f3","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/Add-GzDbProviderFactory.ps1","size":831,"crc32":"9438baf7","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/Get-GzDbConnectionString.ps1","size":1942,"crc32":"f382677b","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/Get-GzDbOption.ps1","size":4159,"crc32":"903e92bf","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/Get-GzDbParameterPrefix.ps1","size":622,"crc32":"abfe3398","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/Get-GzDbProviderFactory.ps1","size":1538,"crc32":"063693be","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/Invoke-GzDbCommand.ps1","size":6144,"crc32":"775af9d5","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/New-GzDbCommand.ps1","size":3719,"crc32":"d3a20e7b","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/New-GzDbConnection.ps1","size":3426,"crc32":"357eb829","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/New-GzDbProviderFactory.ps1","size":792,"crc32":"98935879","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/New-GzSqlClientParameter.ps1","size":2179,"crc32":"fef08d7f","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/Read-GzDbData.ps1","size":4498,"crc32":"763c1777","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/Set-GzDbConnectionString.ps1","size":1060,"crc32":"3d4aef91","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/Set-GzDbProviderFactoryDefault.ps1","size":953,"crc32":"5da266b5","extension":"ps1"},{"path":"public/Write-GzDbData.ps1","size":60